      "area": "General",
      "position": 2,
      "content": "This program must include at least three units of a practicum. POSC 100, the 200-level concentration requirement, and POSC 300 must be completed by the end of the junior year. POSC 100 and one 200-level POSC course must be completed with a grade of 'C' or better. With the exception of internships, all courses used toward the POSC major must be taken for a letter grade. Concentration Requirements - Take three lower-division units and 15 upper-division units in the chosen area of concentration, including the senior seminar in that area. Law, Politics, and Policy concentration: Take POSC 212 or Political Theory concentration: Take POSC 225 or Global Politics concentration: Take POSC 218 or General concentration: Take POSC 199 Consult the CSULB catalog for additional details.",
      "contentHtml": "<p>This program must include at least three units of a practicum.</p><p><br></p><p>POSC 100, the 200-level concentration requirement, and POSC 300 must be completed by the end of the junior year.</p><p><br></p><p>POSC 100 and one 200-level POSC course must be completed with a grade of 'C' or better.</p><p><br></p><p>With the exception of internships, all courses used toward the POSC major must be taken for a letter grade.</p><p><br></p><p>Concentration Requirements - Take three lower-division units and 15 upper-division units in the chosen area of concentration, including the senior seminar in that area.</p><ul><li>Law, Politics, and Policy concentration: Take POSC 212 or</li><li>Political Theory concentration: Take POSC 225 or</li><li>Global Politics concentration: Take POSC 218 or</li><li>General concentration: Take POSC 199</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Consult the <a href=\"https://csulb.catalog.acalog.com/preview_program.php?catoid=12&amp;poid=6492\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CSULB catalog</a> for additional details.</p>"
